PN,31201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786731513
OL,3,CHidden population of rare moth
OL,4,Cdiscovered after conservationist's
OL,5,Clifetime hunt
OL,7,FA hidden population of one of
OL,8,FEngland's rarest moths has been found
OL,9,Fat a site where it has not been seen
OL,10,Ffor 70 years ` by a conservationist
OL,11,Fwho has spent his life searching for
OL,12,Fthem.
OL,14,FDr Dave Wainwright, of Butterfly
OL,15,FConservation, has described his
OL,16,Foverwhelming sense of relief at having
OL,17,Ftracked down a second site in England
OL,18,Ffor the dark bordered beauty moth, at
OL,19,Fthe National Trust's Wallington Estate
OL,20,Fin Northumberland.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786731513
OL,3,CHidden population of rare moth
OL,4,Cdiscovered after conservationist's
OL,5,Clifetime hunt
OL,7,FFor decades before the discovery, the
OL,8,Fonly site where the custard and
OL,9,Fchocolate coloured day-flying moth was
OL,10,Ffound in England was at Strensall
OL,11,FCommon in North Yorkshire.
OL,13,FBut that population has been declining
OL,14,Frapidly, with numbers dwindling from
OL,15,Fhundreds of the moths 20 years ago, to
OL,16,Fbarely reaching double figures last
OL,17,Fyear, Butterfly Conservation said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786731513
OL,3,CHidden population of rare moth
OL,4,Cdiscovered after conservationist's
OL,5,Clifetime hunt
OL,7,FThe site is being affected by climate
OL,8,Fchange, making drought and wildfire
OL,9,Fmore common ` with a blaze that tore
OL,10,Fthrough part of the nature reserve,
OL,11,Fmanaged by Yorkshire Wildlife Trust
OL,12,Fand the Ministry of Defence, last year
OL,13,Fputting the moth in an even more
OL,14,Fperilous situation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
