PN,31204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786731513
OL,3,CHidden population of rare moth
OL,4,Cdiscovered after conservationist's
OL,5,Clifetime hunt
OL,7,FThe discovery of a second population
OL,8,Fin England gives new hope for the rare
OL,9,Fspecies, conservationists said ` not
OL,10,Fleast because the landscape they were
OL,11,Ffound in is different habitat to the
OL,12,FYorkshire site, opening up the
OL,13,Fpossibility they may be found in other
OL,14,Fplaces.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786731513
OL,3,CHidden population of rare moth
OL,4,Cdiscovered after conservationist's
OL,5,Clifetime hunt
OL,7,FThe moth was once widespread across
OL,8,Fnorthern England and Scotland, but has
OL,9,Fseen serious declines as a result of
OL,10,Fhabitat loss and is now restricted to
OL,11,Ftwo small areas on Deeside and
OL,12,FSpeyside in Scotland, as well as the `
OL,13,Fnow two ` sites in England.
OL,15,FA key challenge for conserving the
OL,16,Fmoths is their caterpillars only eat
OL,17,Ftwo plants, aspen and creeping willow.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786731513
OL,3,CHidden population of rare moth
OL,4,Cdiscovered after conservationist's
OL,5,Clifetime hunt
OL,7,FDr Wainwright has been searching for
OL,8,Fnew English colonies since he started
OL,9,Fwork at Butterfly Conservation in 2004
OL,10,F` at work and in his own time
OL,12,FBack in 2004, he visited the
OL,13,FWallington Estate, where the dark
OL,14,Fbordered beauty had previously been
OL,15,Ffound, but not since 1952, but he
OL,16,Ffailed to track down any moths.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786731513
OL,3,CHidden population of rare moth
OL,4,Cdiscovered after conservationist's
OL,5,Clifetime hunt
OL,7,FThis time, however, the habitat had
OL,8,Fbeen transformed by the National Trust
OL,9,Fand its tenant farmer through nature-
OL,10,Ffriendly farming, reducing livestock
OL,11,Fgrazing in key areas and restoring
OL,12,Fpeatland.
OL,14,F"I looked at that site in 2004 and it
OL,15,Fwas quite heavily grazed and wasn't in
OL,16,Fthe right condition for dark bordered
OL,17,Fbeauty," Dr Wainwright said.
OL,19,F"This time the site looked a hell of a
OL,20,Flot better ` really lush vegetation
OL,21,Fwith lots of wildflowers.
OL,26,@vD@AOUyD@HO]{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786731513
OL,3,CHidden population of rare moth
OL,4,Cdiscovered after conservationist's
OL,5,Clifetime hunt
OL,7,F"It only took 10 minutes to find the
OL,8,Ffirst one, then we all started picking
OL,9,Fthem up quite regularly. I think the
OL,10,Fothers were excited, but perhaps not
OL,11,Fas excited as I was."
OL,13,FHe added: "I was hopeful ` I'm always
OL,14,Fhopeful ` but I definitely didn't
OL,15,Fexpect it because I've been to so many
OL,16,Fsites to look for this species over
OL,17,Fthe years, so my heart and my head
OL,18,Fwere in two different places."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@UO]uD@KOUzD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786731513
OL,3,CHidden population of rare moth
OL,4,Cdiscovered after conservationist's
OL,5,Clifetime hunt
OL,7,FWhen they found one within minutes it
OL,8,Fwas, he said, "one of the highlights
OL,9,Fof my career".
OL,11,F"Overwhelmingly it was just a feeling
OL,12,Fof relief that we weren't just
OL,13,Ffighting the fight at one site any
OL,14,Fmore," he added.
OL,16,FEmily Johnson, ranger at Wallington,
OL,17,Fsaid: "We couldn't be more excited to
OL,18,Ffind that Wallington is a stronghold
OL,19,Ffor such a rare species.
OL,26,@pD@OOUqD@MO]sD@AOUvD@FO]yD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786731513
OL,3,CHidden population of rare moth
OL,4,Cdiscovered after conservationist's
OL,5,Clifetime hunt
OL,7,F"We have been working hard to manage
OL,8,Fthe land better for nature, and it
OL,9,Fseems to be paying off."
OL,11,FThe team behind the "Wilder
OL,12,FWallington" nature recovery project
OL,13,Fhope to expand potential habitat for
OL,14,Fthe rare moth, with advice from
OL,15,FButterfly Conservation.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@XO]sD@UOUtD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786731513
OL,3,CHidden population of rare moth
OL,4,Cdiscovered after conservationist's
OL,5,Clifetime hunt
OL,7,FButterfly Conservation is also working
OL,8,Fwith Yorkshire Wildlife Trust to
OL,9,Fmanage habitat at Strensall Common and
OL,10,Fis planning to trial a captive
OL,11,Fbreeding programme, but the charity
OL,12,Fsays the moth is clearly struggling at
OL,13,Fthe site.
OL,15,FDr Wainwright said the discovery at
OL,16,FWallington ` a different environment
OL,17,Fto Strensall on which conservationists
OL,18,Fhad based their idea of "good habitat"
OL,19,Ffor the moths ` opened up a new front
OL,20,Fin their knowledge of the species.
OL,26,@zD@YOUzD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786731513
OL,3,CHidden population of rare moth
OL,4,Cdiscovered after conservationist's
OL,5,Clifetime hunt
OL,7,FHe said other sites came to mind that
OL,8,Fexperts would not have thought of as
OL,9,Fprime dark bordered beauty habitat
OL,10,Fbefore.
OL,12,F"The thing that's kept me going all
OL,13,Fthese years is I always felt there was
OL,14,Fa chance of finding Dark Bordered
OL,15,FBeauty on the Northumberland/Cumbria
OL,16,Fborder ` now it feels like there could
OL,17,Fbe other colonies out there waiting to
OL,18,Fbe discovered which would be
OL,19,Fbrilliant," he added.
OL,26,@tD@AOU{D@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
